        "summary": "A simplified invoice (Fatura Simplificada) / sales receipt from Flying Tiger Copenhagen, issued by Tiger Portugal, SA at F\u00f3rum Coimbra, dated 2021-05-06 11:48. It covers one item, a foldable black bag (BAG FOLDABEL BLACK W), at a total of 3.00 EUR including 23% VAT (0.56 VAT on a 2.44 base), paid by Multibanco. The receipt notes exchanges only with an invoice within 30 days, no returns accepted, and that the document was processed by a certified program (n\u00ba 2648/AT \u2013 Sage) and does not constitute a transport document under Decree-Law n\u00ba 147/2003."
