        "summary": "Simplified invoice (\"Fatura Simplificada\") from Maria da Gl\u00f3ria Cabeleireiros Lda., a hair salon at Centro Comercial Primavera, Coimbra, Portugal (NIF 121653897). Dated 2020-11-04 11:16, it lists two services \u2014 Brushing Medio (\u20ac10.00) and Lavagem (\u20ac2.20), both taxed at 23% IVA \u2014 for a total of \u20ac12.20 EUR, paid in cash (\"Forma Pag. DINHEIRO\"). The VAT breakdown shows \u20ac2.28 tax on a \u20ac9.92 base, and the document notes it was processed by certified Sage software (n\u00ba 2648/AT) and does not constitute a transport document."
