        "summary": "A printed retail credit note (\"Nota de Cr\u00e9dito\") from Zara Home, Forum Coimbra store (Portugal), dated 10-11-2020 at 17:14, number NS 001718012020/000851. It credits 99,99 \u20ac for the return (\"Motivo: Devolu\u00e7\u00e3o\") of one TAPETE (rug, item 4631802940089), with a subtotal of 81,29 \u20ac plus 23% VAT of 18,70 \u20ac. The credit was settled as an exchange of goods (\"Permuta de bens\") and references the original sales document FS 001715012020/014205. The document notes it was processed by a certified tax program (n\u00ba 2742/AT)."
